{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2023-04-24 09:10:00', 'title': 'THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS SELECTS T-MOBILE AS PRIMARY WIRELESS PROVIDER THROUGH 2032', 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--T-MOBILE US, INC. (NASDAQ: TMUS): WHAT'S THE NEWS: AFTER AN EXTENSIVE EVALUATION PROCESS, THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS (VA) SELECTED T-MOBILE AS ITS PRIMARY WIRELESS PROVIDER. THIS EXTENDS T-MOBILE'S COLLABORATION WITH THE VA ANOTHER NINE YEARS. WHY IT MATTERS: THE VA OPERATES THE LARGEST INTEGRATED HEALTHCARE SYSTEM IN THE COUNTRY AND PROVIDES MILLIONS OF VETERANS WITH ACCESS TO HEALTH CARE. WHO IT'S FOR: HEALTH CARE PROVIDERS AND SUPPORT STAFF ACRO."}